Z||000006||JohnnyK||09-01-2000||02:54 PM||||The DeLorean was made in Northern Ireland. It had a volvo engine (they did use a peugot on the original prototype, but that was an I4) with lotus suspension and designed by that guy (yup, thats his name) that designed the Esprit and Scirroco.  I could go on.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||1
Z||000007||JohnnyK||09-01-2000||02:55 PM||||Let me also just add that it was JZD that came up with the GTO and the Firebird (at least he had a big part in the Firebird). Also, the elastomer bumper, and a big part in the air-bag.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||1
